      "Not production-validated; profile-probe only.",
      "Uses coordinate Box selections proven on the local COMSOL 6.4 installation.",
      "Gate H DOF is read from the generated Study Step solver feature (sol1/st1) via XmeshInfo.nDofs(); verified on local COMSOL 6.4 without a solve. Still DISCOVERED, not production-validated."
